//! What each adjust.kdt value does, for the Engine settings page (adjustpage.zig): one
//! row per value the port reads (grep `adjust.get*` and the wrappers in src/fx, src/battle,
//! src/viewer). A name missing here is read only by the original exe (every one of the
//! 600 shipped names is in gorky17.exe's strings). Distances are world units × the
//! actor scale; delays and lifetimes are game ticks.

